  "published": "2026-11-19T08:23:08.71Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Fixed\n\n- `doctor` reports a file whose only change is the newline at its end as a line endings change. It now reports the final newline and the line endings each on its own, against `insert_final_newline` and `end_of_line`, and `--json` carries them as `finalNewline` and `lineEndings` in place of the `line-endings` status. A file that is empty or holds only whitespace gets a warning of its own, since Fantomas leaves it empty whatever `insert_final_newline` asks, and `--json` carries that as `whitespaceOnly` on the `file` key. [#3524](https://github.com/fsprojects/fantomas/issues/3524)",
